fication:\n\n1. The reduction to vertical non\u2011sunny lines (Section\u202f1) is asserted without a rigorous argument that coverage is preserved.\n2. The statement that \u201cthe three lines listed in (10)\u201d are the *only* bound\u2011attaining sunny lines for any odd \\(k\\) is not proved; the necessary translation for the \\(k=3\\) construction is omitted.\n3. The handling of the case \\(|p+q|=1\\) with \\(p+q=-1\\) and \\(q=1\\) is not explicitly discussed.\n4. Minor presentation omissions (e.g., not writing the general formulas for the three bound\u2011attaining lines) are present.\n\nNone of these gaps invalidate the final result; they are **Justification Gaps** (presentation or completeness issues).  Consequently, the solution is **correct** despite the gaps."
